  m_text: 'Welcome to the Bathrooms


    You must open the circuit breaker, but
    to stop students from tampering, custodial has locked it! Solve their clues to
    unlock the circuit breaker and, with any luck, bring power back.


    Use either
    side button to grab objects.

    Grabbable objects will highlight when hovered
    over. Some objects, like keys, can be grabbed from a distance. Others, like doors,
    must be close to grasp.'
